{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood &amp; Chaos\u00a0is a <strong>roguelike RPG</strong> that puts you in command of a  party of adventurers. <br>Build a team of up to six unique heroes, each with their own skills and abilities, and lead them through a perilous, ever-changing world. Strategize, adapt, and overcome challenging turn-based battles as you explore vibrant cities, uncover hidden quests, and delve into deadly dungeons.<br>Will your fellowship rise to become legends, or will they be consumed by the chaos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628880/extras/329da1aa9d5bd1171919921a72f0890c.webp?t=1761139445\" width=616 height=32 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Party</strong>: Create your party of up to 6 heroes, each with \u00a0unique skills and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Turn-Based Combat:</strong>\u00a0<strong>:</strong>\u00a0Engage in challenging battles where every move counts. Position your heroes wisely, exploit enemy weaknesses, and unleash powerful spells and abilities to turn the tide of battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628880/extras/fda11f48536f92203d174ac756e3737c.poster.avif?t=1761139445\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628880/extras/fda11f48536f92203d174ac756e3737c.webm?t=1761139445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628880/extras/fda11f48536f92203d174ac756e3737c.mp4?t=1761139445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dynamic World of Contrasts:</strong>\u00a0Explore a richly detailed medieval fantasy world where beauty and danger coexist. From bustling cities to cursed ruins, every location tells a story of light and shadow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Quests:</strong> Legends speak of a war that nearly consumed the world. Now, remnants of that battle stir once more. What role will you play in the next chapter?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628880/extras/609117c86ed3313137948152d445dd0e.poster.avif?t=1761139445\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628880/extras/609117c86ed3313137948152d445dd0e.webm?t=1761139445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nostalgic Yet Modern:</strong>\u00a0A love letter to '80s RPGs, blending the charm of classic adventures with modern roguelike mechanics and quality-of-life improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2628880?t=1761139445","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628880/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761139445","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628880/98e8127b25700768465a46216f4f33141c5b002e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761139445","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628880/98e8127b25700768465a46216f4f33141c5b002e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761139445","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"